Int. {{son}}'s bedroom


[[beat finding the dvd]]
@{{dad}}
{{son}} {{son}}! Get in here right now

@{{son}}
Okay dad! Coming!

@{{dad}}
{{son}}! What is this?

@{{son}}
I don't kno-

@{{dad}}
This is the 2019 Blu-Ray Special Edition of Cats the Musical

@{{son}}
I'm sorry da-
[[beat big trouble]]
@{{dad}}
Oh if my friends at the glee club ever find out about this you are going to be in big trouble mister


@{{son}}
I'm sorry dad! I don't know how it got there!

@{{dad}}
I think you do know! Ugh! I'm so furious! Thinking you can bring this filth into this house hold. I need to leave! {{mom}} can you get up here? 

@{{son}}
No don't bring mom into this

@{{MOM}}
Hi sweetie. It's {{son}}

@{{dad}}
I can't be in this room with this... this... disappointment

@{{mom}}
It's okay honey I have this. Go take a breather

{{dad}} skips out humming phantom of the opera and dramatically slams door
[[beat holding it for a friend]]

@{{mom}}
Hey baby. You can tell me anything. Why do you have this?

@{{son}}
I'm holding it for a friend

@{{mom}}
Honey. {{son}} I'm not that old. That's the oldest lie in the book

@{{son}}
Okay fine. I... I... enjoy watching the director's journey and this is THE cut

@{{mom}}
Oh this is THE cut? That's some premium stuff

@{{son}}
Right?! Hey. Can you be cool and not tell-


[[beat drug dog]]
@{{dad}}
Your days are numbered @{{son}}. I brought the finest musical sniffing dog on loan from the police department. Say hello to {{dog}}!

{{dog}} comes in a wheelchair

[[beat learned it by watching dad]]

